      Not a runnable fixture yet — this is a .template file on purpose.

      To use it:
      1. On the real site, get to a row with at least one populated
         translation (score page, not /quality_).
      2. In DevTools' Inspector, find the container that holds all the
         [data-module-name="TransN"] blocks AND [data-module-name="Remarks"]
